# Corporate DNS resolvers for the app container.
# In host networking the container still uses its OWN /etc/resolv.conf, which
# Docker populates with public DNS (8.8.8.8) — that cannot resolve internal
# names like the SMTP relay (smtp.its.hpecorp.net). Point it at your corp
# resolvers here. Copy this file to .env on the host (.env is gitignored).
OPAL_DNS1=10.0.0.53
OPAL_DNS2=10.0.0.54
